This project reverse-engineers NVIDIA's SASS encoding and the behavior of
NVIDIA's closed-source `ptxas` by black-box observation only (compiling probe
kernels, diffing `nvdisasm`/`cuobjdump` output, bit-flip fuzzing, and
comparing against real GPU execution). No NVIDIA source code, headers, or
binaries are included or redistributed by this repository; `env/` only holds
a local, gitignored, sha256-verified copy of NVIDIA's own CUDA Toolkit
redistributable, fetched by each user under NVIDIA's own license
(env/fetch_cuda.sh). See WORKFLOW.md for the full method.

