third_party/alphatensor/ vendors files from DeepMind's AlphaTensor repository
(https://github.com/google-deepmind/alphatensor), used here to import the
published fast matrix-multiplication factorizations (Strassen, AlphaTensor
rank-49 4x4x4, etc.) that specs/fastmm/schemes.json.gz is built from.

